      "writtenOn": "2024-11-19T21:01:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s only used in internal binder calls, so we technically don\u0027t need to expose its Parcelable interface. However, `SigningDetails` is an existing class that already implements Parcelable. Is there a way to expose the class without exposing its Parcelable interface?",
