      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-11-20T13:12:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "One alternative is to expose a new interface or wrapper class in the API surface, and SigningDetails implement the new interface or is wrapped by a new class.\n\nActually, Is `android.content.pm.SigningInfo` the existing wrapper of SigningDetails? Can we re-use it and add the new methods there?",
