      "writtenOn": "2024-11-19T21:01:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This code used to belong to `android.content.pm`, but was moved to `android.util.apk` by http://ag/3340390, so I believe there was a reason for it. @mpgroover@google.com What\u0027s your opinion on the package name?",
