      "writtenOn": "2024-11-20T03:36:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My understanding is APK signature verification was moved from the `android.content.pm` package because PackageManager shouldn\u0027t need to know the implementation details of APK signature verification and to have a more generic location for cases like this where other callers need to verify an APK\u0027s (or other supported file type\u0027s) signature. I don\u0027t think this should be exposed as a public API, but my understanding is this will be exposed as a SystemApi, correct?",
      "parentUuid": "af832cde_267a3d4e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 654,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 654,
        "endChar": 24
      },
      "revId": "5b66a7bbc9a8fc903e0728e282097b4320dab2ce",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
