      "writtenOn": "2024-11-20T13:12:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I also agree that PackageManager shouldn\u0027t need to know the implementation details of APK signature verification.\n\nI chatted with Jiakai in Chat, the API surface has an existing class of https://developer.android.com/reference/android/content/pm/SigningInfo `SigningInfo` wrapping `SigningDetails`. The new methods can be added into `SigningInfo` instead of exposing the entire `SigningDetails`.\n\nCan we keep the implementation details in `android.util.apk`, but expose the new APIs in `android.content.pm`?",
      "parentUuid": "7b2cd00b_36730b07",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 654,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 654,
        "endChar": 24
      },
